<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Nestle AG.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Nestle AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG, Zurich, said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Nestle AG registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1500 CHF		  PREMIUM	9.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.70 CHF		  GEARING	12.90 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.FEB.97-21.AUG.98   PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1470 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
